  "description": "High-performance .NET data middleware (super ORM) focused on CRUD and massive data, with multi-level caching, automatic migration, sharding, strongly-typed queries and cross-database migration. 高性能 .NET 数据中间件（超级ORM），聚焦添删改查与海量数据，内置多级缓存、自动迁移、分表分库、强类型查询与跨库迁移。",
